WEBVTT

00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:21.085
Quasi wins again!

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:24.839
When you bump with the hump,
you land on your rump!

00:00:31.762 --> 00:00:33.931
But why all the sudden interest?

00:00:34.015 --> 00:00:36.767
Every time we used to talk
about love, it was always,

00:00:36.851 --> 00:00:38.686
"Dad, that's gross,"

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:41.522
and "Dad, I don't want to know about that."

00:00:41.606 --> 00:00:42.898
I don't know.

00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:45.693
-Sir, he made it into the kitchen.
-He what?

00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:47.153
What do I pay you for?

00:00:47.236 --> 00:00:49.280
I'm sorry, honey. I have to go.

00:00:51.282 --> 00:00:52.617
He doesn't pay me.

00:00:56.871 --> 00:00:58.164
Before you kill me,

00:00:58.247 --> 00:01:00.875
can I please talk to my backpack
one more time?

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:03.252
I don't want to leave anything unresolved.

00:01:03.336 --> 00:01:05.546
Bonjour, Monsieur Dracula!

00:01:05.588 --> 00:01:07.048
Shut your hump hole.

00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:08.549
Now you are helping him?

00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:10.676
What is it with you and this human?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:13.054
He is not human. He's a Stein!

00:01:13.095 --> 00:01:15.348
That's right, little man, I'm a Stein!

00:01:15.431 --> 00:01:19.352
If he is a monster, let him scare Esmeralda!

00:01:19.852 --> 00:01:20.936
The mouse?

00:01:21.604 --> 00:01:23.105
Without a doubt.

00:01:23.606 --> 00:01:25.399
Okay. Here we go.

00:01:36.452 --> 00:01:39.622
A human! A human!

00:01:39.747 --> 00:01:44.418
Monsieur Dracula
has brought a human into the...

00:01:47.296 --> 00:01:50.758
Esmeralda, help me.

00:02:02.978 --> 00:02:07.316
Hey, thanks for saving me back there.
That guy's crazy! Trying to eat me.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:11.320
That's only happened to me one other time.
This weird dude at a Slipknot concert.

00:02:11.445 --> 00:02:13.989
There's something I need to show you.

00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:25.626
Wow.

00:02:25.668 --> 00:02:27.586
Hey, are we at a funeral right now?

00:02:27.837 --> 00:02:30.423
Oh, wait, no, it's your bed.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:33.926
So creepy and cool.

00:02:34.009 --> 00:02:35.970
Wow! I know her!

00:02:36.011 --> 00:02:40.182
I've seen that picture at the ruins of Lubov.
That's my favorite castle.

00:02:40.307 --> 00:02:43.352
-There's a whole legend around that lady.
-A legend?

00:02:45.146 --> 00:02:46.480
The Lady Lubov.

00:02:47.523 --> 00:02:49.191
The story is that a lonely count

00:02:49.316 --> 00:02:52.361
met her by chance,
and they say that no two souls

00:02:52.486 --> 00:02:54.530
were ever more meant for each other.

00:02:54.655 --> 00:02:58.492
Eventually, they settled down
at Castle Lubov and had a child.

00:02:58.534 --> 00:03:02.204
But then, a horrible tragedy happened.

00:03:02.288 --> 00:03:06.834
A fire started mysteriously one night,
and it killed both of them.

00:03:09.211 --> 00:03:14.175
When I was at the castle,
I could still feel their powerful love.

00:03:14.216 --> 00:03:18.804
They say it's as if a soul is still trapped
in the ruins themselves.

00:03:20.848 --> 00:03:22.224
The legend is wrong.

00:03:23.559 --> 00:03:27.813
It was only the wife that died.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:40.159
And it was no mystery who killed her.

00:03:41.368 --> 00:03:43.913
She was killed by your kind!

00:03:44.997 --> 00:03:46.916
Vampire!

00:03:47.917 --> 00:03:50.419
-Honey?
-Go hide. I'll take care of this.

00:03:53.088 --> 00:03:54.381
Vampire!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.678
Martha!

00:04:01.222 --> 00:04:04.225
They are the real monsters.

00:04:13.275 --> 00:04:17.947
I built this place for my love,
to protect her child.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:21.951
As a father, you do everything
to keep your family safe,

00:04:22.034 --> 00:04:25.788
even if you have to break their trust.

00:04:25.871 --> 00:04:30.459
But now, Mavis has feelings for you.

00:04:30.584 --> 00:04:31.627
What?

00:04:31.752 --> 00:04:33.796
I just...

00:04:35.965 --> 00:04:37.967
-Awesome.
-It's all right.

00:04:38.092 --> 00:04:39.802
You are a good one.

00:04:39.927 --> 00:04:42.596
If the world was different,
maybe it would be possible.

00:04:43.264 --> 00:04:44.974
Drac, this is the 21st century.

00:04:45.099 --> 00:04:47.142
People aren't the same
as they were back then.

00:04:47.309 --> 00:04:50.646
Can you tell me for certain
that if we came out in the open,

00:04:50.771 --> 00:04:52.147
everyone would accept us?

00:04:52.273 --> 00:04:53.399
Everyone?

00:04:56.902 --> 00:04:58.988
No. You're right.

00:04:59.655 --> 00:05:01.657
I'll go for good this time.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.993
You can just say I had some emergency,

00:05:04.118 --> 00:05:06.662
or the gremlin lady ate me or something.

00:05:06.787 --> 00:05:08.247
No, no, no, no, no.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.125
I don't want to ruin her birthday party.

00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:14.211
You can sneak out after it's all done.

00:05:14.503 --> 00:05:16.839
I'm sorry.

00:05:16.964 --> 00:05:20.301
The last thing I wanted was to hurt her.

00:05:20.342 --> 00:05:21.510
Or you.

00:05:22.928 --> 00:05:26.515
You know,
you're not the smoothest Frankenstein,

00:05:26.599 --> 00:05:29.101
but you'd make a great vampire.

00:05:29.184 --> 00:05:30.269
For real?

00:05:30.352 --> 00:05:32.104
'Cause I think I kind of got
your hypno-eyes down.

00:05:32.187 --> 00:05:34.815
Oh, boy, here we go. Let me see it.

00:05:34.857 --> 00:05:38.277
Beware! For you are in my power.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:40.779
I command you to be the werewolf man!

00:05:43.198 --> 00:05:44.700
I have too many kids.

00:05:46.702 --> 00:05:49.038
Someone scratch me, I have fleas.

00:05:50.664 --> 00:05:52.207
'Cause he's a wolf, he'd get those.

00:05:52.333 --> 00:05:53.876
Yeah, no, don't explain it.

00:05:53.959 --> 00:05:55.377
It's not funny when you do that.

00:06:17.066 --> 00:06:18.567
I didn't order a wake-up call.

00:06:18.651 --> 00:06:21.695
Count Dracula arranged it for all the rooms.

00:06:23.697 --> 00:06:24.990
Where's the snooze button?

00:06:25.074 --> 00:06:27.242
There will be no snoozing. The party's today.

00:06:48.263 --> 00:06:51.350
Yeah, perfecto.

00:07:05.906 --> 00:07:07.282
Girl

00:07:07.366 --> 00:07:09.702
I can't believe it's your big night

00:07:10.536 --> 00:07:14.456
You ate your frogs, now the party's so right

00:07:15.082 --> 00:07:17.876
Where did the time go, girl?

00:07:22.089 --> 00:07:24.925
And, girl, you used to suck a binky

00:07:24.967 --> 00:07:27.302
Look at you now

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:31.306
You're sucking blood
right out of the cow

00:07:31.432 --> 00:07:33.058
Wow.

00:07:33.142 --> 00:07:35.310
You look beautiful.

00:07:35.436 --> 00:07:37.646
Thanks. Thanks for the party.

00:07:37.771 --> 00:07:39.773
Yeah, you like my little touches?

